%% Designed/deployed data flow from the technical paper.
%% Private logs, deployment configs, and Apps Script source are not included.
flowchart TD
    Reservation[Reservation Data] --> Sheet[Google Sheets]
    Sheet --> Sync[Apps Script or Python Sync]
    Sync --> AuthDB[(MongoDB auth/reservation collections)]

    Login[Login Form] --> UI[PySide UI]
    UI --> AuthDB
    Scene[DCC Scene Data] --> Adapter[Maya or Blender Adapter]
    Adapter --> JobSpec[SceneInfo / RenderSettings / JobSpec]
    JobSpec --> JobInfo[Deadline job_info and plugin_info]

    JobInfo --> Deadline[Deadline Queue]
    Deadline --> WorkerTasks[Worker Task Execution]
    WorkerTasks --> NASInput[NAS Input / Project Data]
    WorkerTasks --> NASOutput[NAS Output]
    WorkerTasks --> Logs[Deadline Task Logs]
    Logs --> OpsNotes[Sanitized Operator Notes]
